{"id":"99e83f097dc38c76","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-finitary-geometric-formula.md","title":"Definition — 原书的有穷几何公式","display":"Definition — 原书的有穷几何公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula","aliases":["14-df-finitary-geometric-formula"],"display":"Definition — 原书的有穷几何公式","depends_on":["[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","[[14-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-finitary-geometric-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 原书的有穷几何公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e987275dbc75bae6\" href=\"?note=e987275dbc75bae6\" title=\"14-df-formula\">14-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 与原子公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_S\">\\(A_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e987275dbc75bae6\" href=\"?note=e987275dbc75bae6\" title=\"14-df-formula\">14-df-formula</a>。</li>\n<li>此处沿原书 X.3 的有穷语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee,\\exists\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee,\\exists\\)</span> 分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{ex}\">\\(\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{ex}\\)</span> 的排版记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_S^0:=A_S,\\quad G_S^{n+1}:=G_S^n\\cup\\{\\varphi\\wedge\\psi,\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in G_S^n\\}\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\mid x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S,\\varphi\\in G_S^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_S^0:=A_S,\\quad G_S^{n+1}:=G_S^n\\cup\\{\\varphi\\wedge\\psi,\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in G_S^n\\}\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\mid x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S,\\varphi\\in G_S^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}G_S^n,\\qquad\\mathrm{IsGeometricFormula}_S(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}G_S^n,\\qquad\\mathrm{IsGeometricFormula}_S(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 X.3，印刷 pp.536–537：仅二元合取、二元析取和存在量词，且 ⊤、⊥ 属原子基例。现代文献常把本片段称为 coherent logic，任意集合大小析取则属更广的 geometric logic。本原子忠实保留原书范围，修正旧稿无界幂集封闭伪集合问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e987275dbc75bae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0d0e27d414f41634","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 与原子公式集 $A_S$ 见 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]、[[14-df-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e987275dbc75bae6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 与原子公式集 $A_S$ 见 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]、[[14-df-formula]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge,\\vee,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{ex}","display":false},{"tex":"G_S^0:=A_S,\\quad G_S^{n+1}:=G_S^n\\cup\\{\\varphi\\wedge\\psi,\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in G_S^n\\}\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\mid x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S,\\varphi\\in G_S^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}G_S^n,\\qquad\\mathrm{IsGeometricFormula}_S(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S.","display":true}],"bytes":1281,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula|Definition — 原书的有穷几何公式]]"},{"id":"f9eae1f4309444c6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名。几何公式集合 $\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S$ 采用 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]；$\\operatorname{Ctx}_S$、$|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x)$ 采用 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]；自由变量、$\\equiv_\\alpha$、单项及同时替换采用 [[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution]]。$\\mathbb T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S$，$D$ 是候选可导序列集合。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula|Definition — 原书的有穷几何公式]]"},{"id":"e174b0a1a0ce73b6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 IX.11 p.519 及 X.5–6。语法范畴有有限极限，语法覆盖由有限几何析取生成，故给出有限覆盖族基，满足[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]]。该结论依赖[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]采用原书有穷片段；对现代任意无穷析取几何理论不能直接沿用。"},{"id":"390383982043afea","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S$ 采用 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]；$P\\subseteq\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S$，$A_S$ 是原子基例集合。"},{"id":"f2895e14ad640cde","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0d0e27d414f41634","e987275dbc75bae6"]}